    <string name="native_aboutScreen_benchmarkBody" formatted="false">BoarLite measures every answer on your own phone: model load time, time to the first word, tokens per second, peak memory and which sources were used. Run the built-in evaluation from the menu, Evaluation, to compare installed models on the same questions, or run it from a computer over adb (see AGENTS.md on GitHub).</string>
